claude_session_archive__projects__-workspace-SuperGrok1-5__122b3aee-fa74-43c0-936d-39ff1eca854f__subagents__agent-ada2f0e60b2e71d6e.jsonl.txt:3333:@@REC98|assistant|assistant|2026-06-09T23:54:08.861Z@@ Honesty consequence: `print_summary`/`plot_comparison` average over `len(runs)` survivors only (e.g. line 1311 `np.mean([... for r in kv[1]])`). An optimizer whose *difficult* seeds crash has those seeds dropped from its mean, so it can score **better** than one that DNFs honestly on the same seeds. Combined with H1 (DNFs counted at max_steps), the scoreboard is gameable by crash. Spec (no edit): record a placeholder DNF/CRASH `TrainResult` for failed cells so N is constant across optimizers, and surface a per-optimizer crash count in the summary + JSON.
